#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0340 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "PROPOSED-RULE scenario (ruling 8). Mirror of CDISC-SEND-0014-valid_permissible_no_comment-DM: Permissible BRTHDTC populated, declared without a comment; library BRTHDTC core=Perm. Proposed rule silent. CURRENT rule fires on every declared variable without a comment -> predicted-red: engine reports exactly 1 violation (define_variable_name=BRTHDTC) where this scenario expects noViolation."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#library variable-metadata DM BRTHDTC core=Perm
#define-xml CDISC-SEND-0340-perm-define.xml
dataset DM
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col BRTHDTC type=Char
---
S1 | S1-001 | 2020-01-01
